// 34
[struct_34]
param=param_463,shadow warriors
param=param_460,32
param=param_462,Shadow warriors are dark and mysterious. They hide in the shadows, so be wary of ambushes. The basement of the Legends' Guild harbours these menaces.
param=param_465,65
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_158

// 35
[struct_35]
param=param_463,werewolves
param=param_460,33
param=param_462,Werewolves are feral creatures; strong and tough with sharp claws and teeth. The village of Canifis is home to many of them.
param=param_465,60
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_6014

// 36
[struct_36]
param=param_463,bloodvelds
param=param_460,48
param=param_462,Bloodveld are strange, demonic creatures that use their long, rasping tongue to feed on just about anything they can find. If you wish to slay some, they live in the Slayer Tower to the north-west of Canifis.
param=param_465,65
param=param_466,50
param=param_659,npc_1618

// 37
[struct_37]
param=param_463,killerwatts
param=param_460,73
param=param_462,Killerwatts store huge amounts of energy in their bodies, which is released if they are touched. You'll need to wear heavily insulated boots to counter this shocking effect, plus they can attack speedily with both magic and missiles. To access their cloudy plane, you'll need to explore Draynor Manor.
param=param_465,60
param=param_466,37
param=param_659,npc_3201

// 38
[struct_38]
param=param_463,crocodiles
param=param_460,65
param=param_462,Crocodiles are large reptiles that live in the Kharidian Desert near water. River crocodiles are a bigger challenge then the ones found next to the ocean in the south east.
param=param_465,40
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_1993

// 39
[struct_39]
param=param_463,ogres
param=param_460,20
param=param_462,Ogres are brutal creatures, favouring large blunt maces and clubs. They often attack without warning. South of Yanille is an area ruled by these man-devourers.
param=param_465,65
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_3419

// 40
[struct_40]
param=param_463,sea snakes
param=param_460,71
param=param_462,Sea snakes are long and slithery, with a venomous bite. The larger ones are more dangerous, so keep an eye on your health. They live on isles far to the north-west, or, rather, in the sea caves of those isles.
param=param_465,60
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_3939

// 41
[struct_41]
param=param_463,moss giants
param=param_460,17
param=param_462,Like other giants, moss giants often wield large weapons. Use fire spells to burn them to cinders before they can damage you. Strangely for giants, some have been seen at the end of the Varrock sewers.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_112

// 42
[struct_42]
param=param_463,aberrant spectres
param=param_460,41
param=param_462,Aberrant spectres are fetid, vile ghosts. The very smell of them will paralyse and harm you. A nosepeg will help you ignore their stink and make you fight at full capacity. Sniff them out in the Slayer Tower in Morytania.
param=param_465,70
param=param_466,60
param=param_659,npc_1604

// 43
[struct_43]
param=param_463,lesser demons
param=param_460,28
param=param_462,Lesser demons are magic creatures, so they are weak to ranged attacks. Although they're relatively weak, they are still dangerous. Taverley Dungeon is home to these foul creatures.
param=param_465,65
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_82

// 44
[struct_44]
param=param_463,jungle horrors
param=param_460,81
param=param_462,Jungle horrors can be found all over Mos Le'Harmless. They are strong, aggressive and fight in packs, so watch out!
param=param_465,65
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_4352

// 45
[struct_45]
param=param_463,turoths
param=param_460,36
param=param_462,Turoths are large, vicious creatures with thick hides. You'll need a leaf-bladed weapon, broad arrows or a magic dart to harm them. You can find a nest of them in the Rellekka Slayer Caves.
param=param_465,60
param=param_466,55
param=param_659,npc_1627

// 46
[struct_46]
param=param_463,ankous
param=param_460,79
param=param_462,Ankous are neither ghost nor skeleton, but a combination of both. Not much is known of these creatures. Perform some research in the depths of the Stronghold of Security.
param=param_465,55
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_4381

// 47
[struct_47]
param=param_463,ice giants
param=param_460,15
param=param_462,Like other giants, ice giants often wield large weapons. Try using fire spells to melt them before they can hit you. Ice giants can be found underground to the south of Port Sarim.
param=param_659,npc_111

// 48
[struct_48]
param=param_463,green dragons
param=param_460,24
param=param_462,Green dragons are the weakest dragons but they are still very powerful. Watch out for their fiery breath. These brutes live out in the Wilderness.
param=param_465,60
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_941

// 49
[struct_49]
param=param_463,jellies
param=param_460,50
param=param_462,Jellies are nasty, cube-like gelatinous creatures that absorb everything they come across. Their acidic touch attacks in the same fashion as many magics, so prepare your armour beforehand. They keep parts of Rellekka Slayer Caves clean.
param=param_465,65
param=param_466,52
param=param_659,npc_1637

// 50
[struct_50]
param=param_463,infernal mages
param=param_460,40
param=param_462,Infernal mages are dangerous spell users; beware of their Magic spells and go properly prepared. They have taken over an area upstairs in the Slayer Tower, plotting your doom.
param=param_465,70
param=param_466,45
param=param_659,npc_1643

// 51
[struct_51]
param=param_463,brine rats
param=param_460,84
param=param_462,Brine rats can be found in caves near to the sea. They are hairless, bad-tempered and generally unfriendly. If you have found Olaf's pirate treasure, you'll know where to find these targets.
param=param_466,47
param=param_659,npc_3707

// 52
[struct_52]
param=param_463,basilisks
param=param_460,43
param=param_462,Basilisks, like cockatrices, have a gaze which will paralyse and harm their prey. You'll need a mirror shield to protect you. Basilisks live in the Rellekka Slayer Caves, along with their cockatrice relatives.
param=param_465,70
param=param_466,40
param=param_659,npc_1616

// 53
[struct_53]
param=param_463,vampyres
param=param_460,34
param=param_462,Vampyres are extremely powerful beings. They feed on the blood of the living, so watch that you don't get bitten. Look in the woods of Morytania.
param=param_465,55
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_1220

// 54
[struct_54]
param=param_463,molanisks
param=param_460,87
param=param_462,Molanisks are subterranean creatures. You can find them in caves deep below the ground. I heard that the goblins have recently had trouble with some, but they use a bell to lure them from the cave wall.
param=param_466,39
param=param_659,npc_5751

// 55
[struct_55]
param=param_463,pyrefiends
param=param_460,47
param=param_462,Pyrefiends are magical beings of fire and molten rock. They're quick and agile so try attacking them with a crossbow and bolts. You can find some fiends in the Rellekka Slayer Caves.
param=param_465,55
param=param_466,30
param=param_659,npc_1633

// 56
[struct_56]
param=param_463,shades
param=param_460,64
param=param_462,Shades are undead - The town of Mort'ton in Morytania is plagued by these creatures, so help if you can. There are some shades in the Stronghold of Security too, but you won't learn much from fighting those; stick to Mort'ton.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_1241

// 57
[struct_57]
param=param_463,earth warriors
param=param_460,54
param=param_462,Earth warriors are an elemental warrior pieced together by rocks. Water washes them away easily so use spells of that type. They form from the rocks beneath Edgeville.
param=param_465,70
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_124

// 58
[struct_58]
param=param_463,cockatrices
param=param_460,44
param=param_462,Cockatrices, like basilisks, have a gaze which will paralyse and harm their prey. You'll need a mirror shield to protect you. If you are brave enough, head to Slayer Caves east of Rellekka.
param=param_466,25
param=param_659,npc_1620

// 59
[struct_59]
param=param_463,crawling hands
param=param_460,39
param=param_462,Crawling hands are undead severed hands; fast and dexterous, they claw their victims. They can be found in the Slayer Tower, north-east of the entrance to Morytania.
param=param_465,10
param=param_466,5
param=param_659,npc_1648

// 60
[struct_60]
param=param_463,wolves
param=param_460,9
param=param_462,Wolves are pack animals, so you'll always find them in groups. Watch out for their bite, it can be nasty. There are plenty to kill on White Wolf Mountain.
param=param_465,8
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_95

// 61
[struct_61]
param=param_463,cave bugs
param=param_460,63
param=param_462,Cave bugs are like cave crawlers, except smaller and easier to squish; although, they still have a fondness for plants. They lurk in the dark beneath Lumbridge Swamp.
param=param_465,8
param=param_466,7
param=param_659,npc_5750

// 62
[struct_62]
param=param_463,cows
param=param_460,6
param=param_462,Cows are bigger than you, and they'll often hit hard but react fairly slowly. You can slaughter the ones in Lumbridge - I bet they are up to no good.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_81

// 63
[struct_63]
param=param_463,birds
param=param_460,5
param=param_462,Birds aren't the most intelligent of creatures, but watch out for their sharp, stabbing beaks. Even the chickens in Lumbridge are after your blood, so get them before they get you.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,null

// 64
[struct_64]
param=param_463,gelatinous abominations
param=param_460,111
param=param_462,These mindless creatures attack relentlessly once provoked. There is a core floating in their chest, and they can only be beaten by bursting this core wearing spiked gauntlets, once you have damaged them enough.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_14849

// 65
[struct_65]
param=param_463,trolls
param=param_460,18
param=param_462,There are plenty of trolls not far from here. Head up to the cave between the Wall and Burthorpe castle if you want to find them. There are three sub-caves in there, one with shamans, another with warriors and another with rangers. Take your pick of how to take them down!
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,null

// 66
[struct_66]
param=param_3152,npc_6911
param=param_7494,1

