param=param_6135,Mental Health Awareness Week
param=param_6137,Support our Charities by purchasing the Meditation bundle. For more information on CPSL Mind and Rise Above the Disorder please head to the Charities tab.<br><br>In the bundle you will receive:<br> The Cloak and Banner of Meditation<br> The Stone of Meditation<br> 10x Advanced pulse core<br> 5x Cinder core<br> 5x Portable skilling pack<br> 5x Large protean pack<br><br>Use your Stone of Meditation to grant you a 4% XP boost whilst giving those around you a 2% boost for an hour. 2 additional charges are awarded daily (up to a maximum of 5) until June 13th, after which your Stone of Meditation will be converted into 2500 Oddments.
param=param_6138,tle_mhaw_2021_overview_bg
