// 524
[struct_524]
param=param_4832,Flames of Zamorak
param=param_4833,Zamorak slams the floor with his hands and then smashes his wings into the ground. The impact of both deals <col=FFFFFF>melee damage</col> to all targets, increasing in damage the closer they are to the impact zones.<br><br>After the initial impact, Zamorak will send a line of flames towards a random target. For each active flame, Zamorak gains a stack of <col=FFFFFF>Shrouded in flames</col>, which provides a <col=FFFFFF>1%</col> damage reduction to all incoming damage.<br><br>Running over a flame will pick up a stack of <col=FFFFFF>Flames of Zamorak</col>. <col=FFFFFF>10 seconds</col> after picking up the first stack, the target will explode for <col=FFFFFF>500</col> damage per stack held and <col=FFFFFF>1%</col> of this damage will penetrate through defensive and shielding effects per stack held.<br><br>If a player enters <col=FFFFFF>Infernus</col> with <col=FFFFFF>Flames of Zamorak</col> stacks, the eruption will detonate instantly and increase the penetration through defensive and shielding effects to <col=FFFFFF>3%</col> per stack held.<br><br>Damage from this attack is scaled with Enrage %.
param=param_4835,seq_34910

