// 909
[struct_909]
param=param_463,dark beasts
param=param_460,66
param=param_462,Dark beasts are large, dog-like predators with massively muscled bodies that protect them from crushing weapons. I've managed to trap a few in the dungeon I'm guarding.
param=param_466,90
param=param_659,npc_2783

// 910
[struct_910]
param=param_463,abyssal demons
param=param_460,180
param=param_462,Abyssal demons are nasty creatures to deal with. They aren't really part of this realm and are able to move very quickly to trap their prey. I've managed to trap a few in the dungeon I'm guarding.
param=param_466,85
param=param_659,npc_1615

// 911
[struct_911]
param=param_463,nechryael
param=param_460,52
param=param_462,Nechryael are demons of decay that summon small winged beings to help them fight their victims. They can be found in the Chaos Tunnels or in Canifis Slayer Tower.
param=param_466,80
param=param_659,npc_1613

// 912
[struct_912]
param=param_463,hellhounds
param=param_460,31
param=param_462,Hellhounds are a cross between dogs and demons; they are also dangerous with a fierce bite. I've managed to trap a few in the dungeon I'm guarding.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_49

// 913
[struct_913]
param=param_463,gargoyles
param=param_460,46
param=param_462,Gargoyles are winged creatures of stone. You'll need to fight them until they are close to death before breaking them apart with a rock hammer. I've managed to trap a few in the dungeon I'm guarding.
param=param_466,75
param=param_659,npc_1610

// 914
[struct_914]
param=param_463,dust devils
param=param_460,49
param=param_462,Dust devils use clouds of dust, sand, ash and whatever else they can inhale to blind and disorientate their victims. Good luck on obtaining a dragon chainmail from their dusty remains.
param=param_466,65
param=param_659,npc_1624

// 915
[struct_915]
param=param_463,aberrant spectres
param=param_460,41
param=param_462,Aberrant spectres are fetid, vile ghosts. The very smell of them will paralyse and harm you. A nosepeg will help ignore their stink when fighting them. They can be found in the Slayer Tower near Canifis and I have heard rumours that they also live beneath Pollnivneach in the desert.
param=param_466,60
param=param_659,npc_1604

// 916
[struct_916]
param=param_463,TzHaar
param=param_460,101
param=param_462,The TzHaar contains some mighty warriors, prove yourself against them. You'll find them deep within the Karamja volcano.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,null

// 917
[struct_917]
param=param_463,warped tortoises
param=param_460,92
param=param_462,Warped tortoises are creatures tainted by magical waste. They are vulnerable to an elven chime. I know you have seen them in your adventures, so go crack some carapace.
param=param_466,56
param=param_659,npc_6297

// 918
[struct_918]
param=param_463,iron dragons
param=param_460,59
param=param_462,Iron dragons are some of the weaker metallic dragons, with iron scales that are far thicker than normal iron armour. Their fiery breath and sharp claws can be negated by a number of means. I've managed to trap a few in the dungeon I'm guarding.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_1591

// 919
[struct_919]
param=param_463,steel dragons
param=param_460,60
param=param_462,Steel dragons are dangerous and metallic, with steel scales that are far thicker than normal steel armour. I've managed to trap a few in the dungeon I'm guarding.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_1592

// 920
[struct_920]
param=param_463,blue dragons
param=param_460,25
param=param_462,Blue dragons aren't as strong as other dragons, but they're still very powerful. I've managed to trap a few in the dungeon I'm guarding.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_55

// 921
[struct_921]
param=param_463,black dragons
param=param_460,27
param=param_462,Black dragons are among the strongest dragons and are very fierce. Watch out for their fiery breath. I am sure you will have seen them in your travels and have honed your techniques on lesser dragons.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_54

// 922
[struct_922]
param=param_463,skeletal wyverns
param=param_460,72
param=param_462,Skeletal wyverns are extremely dangerous, and they are hard to hit with arrows as they slip right through. To stand a good chance of surviving, you'll need some elemental shielding from their icy breath.
param=param_466,72
param=param_659,npc_3068

// 923
[struct_923]
param=param_463,terror dogs
param=param_460,86
param=param_462,Terror dogs are, unsurprisingly, dogs that terrorise the weak. You'll find them in the Haunted Mine, near Tarn's lair.
param=param_466,40
param=param_659,npc_5417

// 924
[struct_924]
param=param_463,living rock creatures
param=param_460,106
param=param_462,Found beneath the Dwarven mines, these are tough beings of rock. They can use ranged or melee attacks against you, so plan accordingly!
param=param_465,80
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_8832

// 925
[struct_925]
param=param_463,greater demons
param=param_460,29
param=param_462,Greater demons are weak to ranged attacks. Though not the strongest of demons, they are still dangerous. I've managed to trap a few in the dungeon I'm guarding.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_83

// 926
[struct_926]
param=param_463,black demons
param=param_460,30
param=param_462,Black demons are weak to ranged attacks. They're still the strongest demon and very dangerous, however. Seek them out in the Edgeville or Brimhaven dungeons.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_84

// 927
[struct_927]
param=param_463,suqahs
param=param_460,83
param=param_462,Suqahs can only be found on the mystical Lunar Isle. They use melee and magical attacks, and they often drop hide, teeth and herbs.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_4527

// 928
[struct_928]
param=param_463,mithril dragons
param=param_460,94
param=param_462,Mithril dragons are very dangerous opponents. They live just north of where we are now. You are a battle master - test your skills.
param=param_465,90
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_5363

// 929
[struct_929]
param=param_463,spiritual mages
param=param_460,91
param=param_462,Spiritual mages are the strongest of the spiritual guardians. They are devastating against warriors, but a smart ranger can sometimes defeat them. Of course, Prayer might serve you well, too. They can be found in the icy caverns near Trollheim, supporting the cause of their chosen god.
param=param_466,83
param=param_659,npc_6231

// 930
[struct_930]
param=param_463,bloodveld
param=param_460,48
param=param_462,Bloodvelds are strange, demonic creatures. They use their long, rasping tongue to feed on just about anything they can find. Remember that their tongues are magical in nature, but, more so, they deserve to die.
param=param_466,50
param=param_659,npc_7642

// 931
[struct_931]
param=param_463,fire giants
param=param_460,16
param=param_462,Like other giants, fire giants often wield large weapons. Learn to recognise what kind of weapon it is and act accordingly. Remember the days when these were a challenge to you and laugh.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_110

// 932
[struct_932]
param=param_463,kalphites
param=param_460,53
param=param_462,Kalphites are large insects that live in hives under the desert sands. I am sure that, by now, you have seen them to the south-west of Shantay Pass.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_1154

// 933
[struct_933]
param=param_463,waterfiends
param=param_460,88
param=param_462,Waterfiends are creatures of water that live just north of us. Those followed by familiars are keen to slay these elemental forces.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_5361

// 934
[struct_934]
param=param_463,volcanic creatures
param=param_460,102
param=param_462,These are the creatures that live within the TzHaar fightcaves. You'll have to venture down into the cave in the Karamja volcano to take them on.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,null

