param=param_2153,npc_14493
param=param_2168,npc_14494
param=param_2123,35
param=param_2124,29
param=param_2097,1
param=param_2184,Probably the tallest monster ever to exist, this lumbering beast embodies destruction and decay.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Nomad's Requiem<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: A fearsome foe that replenishes his health from the roots that appear around the arena. Remove the roots to avoid the avatar replenishing itself and the fight taking longer than it needs to.
