param=param_2126,30
param=param_2097,2
param=param_2184,These two creatures are the stuff of (very bizarre) dreams. One of them tries very little to avoid confrontation but is incredibly tough, whereas the other is a nuisance to chase down yet can be killed with a couple of blows.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Dream Mentor<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: One very tough, one tricky to reach. They both attack with melee, but you'll have Cyrisus with you to help out a bit.
