param=param_2184,These chaps are so identical they must be closely related! They are of the race of sea creatures that cause havoc for the Fremennik.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Blood Runs Deep<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: These bad boys work as a fearsome pair. They will restore each other's health if you concentrate on one for too long. They attack with a mixture of melee, magic and ranged.
