param=param_2184,An enormous black demon, a creature of the underworld and altogether evil being. If he doesn't slash his enemies to pieces with his claws, they're likely to succumb to his vicious magic.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Legend's Quest<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: The huge black demon will attack with magic unless you run in and attack close range, at which he will switch to attack with his claws.
