param=param_2124,29
param=param_2097,1
param=param_2184,Now that's a very big blue bird! It's swift and deadly and attacks from above unlike most other creatures likely to be found in Gielinor.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: My Arm's Big Adventure<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: This bird of epic proportions will use several types of attack. Occasionally it will knock you back, stunning you. It pecks at your eyes with its melee attack and throws boulders to deal ranged damage.
