// 3439
[struct_3439]
param=param_4832,Infernal Tomb
param=param_4833,Zamorak will send an edict symbol towards all targets in the encounter which will force them into <col=FFFFFF>Infernus</col> after a short period of time and then enter his <col=FFFFFF>Decimate</col> attack.<br><br> Whilst on <col=FFFFFF>Infernus</col>, each target will need to escape by stepping into the symbol that matched the symbol Zamorak cast on them.<br><br>Within <col=FFFFFF>Infernus</col>, a <col=FFFFFF>Chaos Demon</col> will spawn for each target sent in. These demons will path towards the entry portal in an attempt to reach Zamorak. Any Chaos Demons that escape <col=FFFFFF>Infernus</col> and reach the main arena will double their lifepoints and <col=FFFFFF>Fixate</col> on a random target, unable to be <col=FFFFFF>Provoked</col> away. Each consequtive hit will make the demons stronger.<br><br>Damage from this attack is scaled with Enrage %.
param=param_4835,seq_34904

