// 3695
[struct_3695]
param=param_2795,<br>Apply a stack of abyssal parasites to the target. <br>Targets afflicted by abyssal parasites take <col=ffffff>18-31</col> bleed damage <col=ffffff>5</col> times over <col=ffffff>9</col> seconds. <br>Additional parasites applied refresh the duration and increase the damage dealt by <col=ffffff>18-31</col>, capping at <col=ffffff>937-1562</col> damage per hit. <br>Enemies that die whilst afflicted with abyssal parasites spread 50% of their total stacks to all nearby enemies (does not work in PvP).
param=param_3830,1

// 3696
[struct_3696]
param=param_2795,On damaging basic melee abilities: Generate an additional 2% adrenaline (1% in PvP) per bleed damage over time on the target.

// 3697
[struct_3697]
param=param_2795,On damaging an enemy: 25% chance to apply a stack of parasite to deal 5 times 18-31 bleed damage over 9 seconds. Each additional activation within this timeframe adds another stack of parasites and restarts the effect, capping at 937-1562 damage per hit. If an enemy dies with the parasites affecting them, 50% of them will spread to all nearby enemies (does not work in PvP).

