// 3705
[struct_3705]
param=param_4832,Chaos blast
param=param_4833,Zamorak will let out a burst of energy, removing all active overhead prayers. Zamorak's main target's position will be targeted with a barrage of chaos damage dealing <col=FFFFFF>magic damage</col> split between targets who remain at the chosen position, or <col=FFFFFF>typeless damage</col> to all targets if no one stands in the targeted area, as well as having <col=FFFFFF>10%</col> of their adrenaline drained and a adrenaline gain debuff applied.<br><br>Damage from this attack is scaled with Enrage %.
param=param_4835,seq_34905

// 3706
[struct_3706]
param=param_4832,Chaos witch
param=param_4833,Once Zamorak hits his lifepoint cap for his current phase, he'll call forth and channel from a <col=FFFFFF>Chaos witch</col> from within <col=FFFFFF>Infernus</col>, also preventing any Edict pad from being charged up. Whilst channeling from this witch, Zamorak will progressivly gain more power for his <col=FFFFFF>Berserk phase</col>.<br><br>Once the witch is killed, Zamorak's targets will once again have the ability to charge up an Edict by stepping on the pads.

// 3707
[struct_3707]
param=param_8202,183
param=param_3839,enum_12599
param=param_4921,dbrow_6385
param=param_7983,struct_7070
param=param_858,model_126627
param=param_859,seq_22665
param=param_860,seq_22664
param=param_7171,false
param=param_4640,rs3_thbanner_foresight_to_train_default_en
param=param_4639,rs3_thbanner_foresight_to_train_default_de
param=param_4642,rs3_thbanner_foresight_to_train_default_fr
param=param_4643,rs3_thbanner_foresight_to_train_default_pt
param=param_8205,69
param=param_388,1
param=param_8544,true
param=param_8543,dbrow_6404
param=param_6381,rs3_lobby_secondary_foresight_to_train_q3_2023_en
param=param_6385,rs3_lobby_secondary_foresight_to_train_q3_2023_de
param=param_6386,rs3_lobby_secondary_foresight_to_train_q3_2023_fr
param=param_6387,rs3_lobby_secondary_foresight_to_train_q3_2023_pt
param=param_6392,1
param=param_4575,true

// 3708
[struct_3708]
param=param_4832,Zamorak's last stand
param=param_4833,In encounters of <col=FFFFFF>100% enrage</col> or higher, Zamorak will make a last ditch attempt to kill the player by pulling them into <col=FFFFFF>Infernus</col>.<br><br>Zamorak will draw from each hexed edict symbol in a random order, building up <col=FFFFFF>Chaos damage</col> whilst channelling from them. Targets can disrupt and stagger Zamorak by attacking the correct order of symbols shown in order to open up Zamorak for attack.<br><br>As Zamorak's damage window is opened up, he'll slam the floor, dealing <col=FFFFFF>melee damage</col>, dealing increased damage the closer the targets are to him.<br><br>After this strike, Zamorak will deal the total amount of <col=FFFFFF>Chaos damage</col> as one big hit with <col=FFFFFF>50%</col> of this damage penetrating through defensives and shielding effects, stacking with the <col=E80404>Disintegration</col> hex, to every target on <col=FFFFFF>Infernus</col>, which will deal further <col=FFFFFF>AoE damage</col> if targets are standing close to each other.<br><br>Once Zamorak's damage window is closed, he'll repeat the melee slam and Chaos Damage hit before beginning to channel from the symbols once more.<br><br>Damage from this attack is scaled with Enrage %.
param=param_4835,seq_34910

