// 15372
[struct_15372]
param=param_3044,Using the Action Bar and Abilities
param=param_3045,Teaches you how to use the action bar. Introduces abilities and ability based combat.<br><br>Demonstration:<br>Kill waves of skeletons using abilities.<br><br>Hover over the rank icons to see completion requirements.
param=param_3046,#1 Legend Rank<br><br>Kill all the skeletons while using multiple abilities from the action bar.
param=param_3047,#2 Hero Rank<br><br>Kill all the skeletons and use an ability.
param=param_3048,#3 Champion Rank<br><br>Kill all the skeletons.
