[struct_26537]
param=param_4832,Phase Shift
param=param_4833,Powerful celestial dragons can phase through dimensional space, and thus Astellarn takes greatly reduced damage as she is able to mitigate direct hits. Standing in a stabilised <col=FFFFFF>Wyrmhole</col> will balance out this effect however.

// 26538
[struct_26538]
param=param_4832,Celestial Rain
param=param_4833,Cosmic rain particles will fall on random quadrants in the arena, causing increased <col=FFFFFF>typeless</col> damage over time.

// 26539
[struct_26539]
param=param_4832,Dead Beasts
param=param_4833,In each corner of the graveyard are long-dead, preserved beasts. After the disruption caused from Croesus, these buried creatures have been uncovered and are a perfect resource for Croesus's fungus to grow. Remove the fungus from these to weaken Croesus and gather useful resources. Be vigilant - removed fungus will eventually grow back and strengthen Croesus again. Use rotten fungus to create a poisonous paste that can slow down the regrowth.

