// 28737
[struct_28737]
param=param_463,dark beasts
param=param_460,66
param=param_462,Dark beasts are large, dog-like predators with massively muscled bodies that protect them from crushing weapons. We found some while mining the Mourner tunnels, in search of the Temple of Light.
param=param_466,90
param=param_659,npc_2783

// 28738
[struct_28738]
param=param_463,Abyssal demons
param=param_460,180
param=param_462,Abyssal demons are nasty creatures to deal with. They aren't really part of this realm and are able to move very quickly to trap their prey. They can be found in Canifis Slayer Tower and in the Senntisten Asylum.
param=param_466,85
param=param_659,npc_1615

// 28739
[struct_28739]
param=param_463,gargoyles
param=param_460,46
param=param_462,Gargoyles are winged creatures of stone. You'll need to fight them until they are close to death before breaking them apart with a rock hammer. They can be found in Canifis Slayer Tower.
param=param_466,75
param=param_659,npc_1610

// 28740
[struct_28740]
param=param_463,iron dragons
param=param_460,59
param=param_462,Iron dragons are some of the weaker metallic dragons, with iron scales that are far thicker than normal iron armour. Their fiery breath and sharp claws can be negated by a number of means. Look for them in Brimhaven Dungeon.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_1591

// 28741
[struct_28741]
param=param_463,steel dragons
param=param_460,60
param=param_462,Steel dragons are dangerous and metallic, with steel scales that are far thicker than normal steel armour. Look for them in Brimhaven Dungeon.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_1592

// 28742
[struct_28742]
param=param_463,black dragons
param=param_460,27
param=param_462,Black dragons are among the strongest dragons and are very fierce. Watch out for their fiery breath. I am sure you will have seen them in your travels and have honed your techniques on lesser dragons.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_54

// 28743
[struct_28743]
param=param_463,greater demons
param=param_460,29
param=param_462,Greater demons are weak to ranged attacks. Though not the strongest of demons, they are still dangerous. There are some in Brimhaven Dungeon.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_83

// 28744
[struct_28744]
param=param_463,black demons
param=param_460,30
param=param_462,Black demons are weak to ranged attacks. They're still the strongest demon and very dangerous, however. Seek them out in the Edgeville or Brimhaven dungeons.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_84

// 28745
[struct_28745]
param=param_463,mithril dragons
param=param_460,94
param=param_462,Mithril dragons are very dangerous opponents. There's some in the Ancient Cavern, north of where you'll find Kuradal. You are a battle master - test your skills.
param=param_465,90
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_5363

// 28746
[struct_28746]
param=param_463,kalphites
param=param_460,53
param=param_462,Kalphites are large insects that live in hives under the desert sands. I am sure that, by now, you have seen them to the south-west of Shantay Pass.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_1154

// 28747
[struct_28747]
param=param_463,dagannoth
param=param_460,35
param=param_462,Dagannoth are large, sea-dwelling creatures that are very aggressive. You'll often find them in caves near sea water. There is no joy so great as to cleanse these from the face of Gielinor.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_1339

// 28748
[struct_28748]
param=param_463,ice strykewyrms
param=param_460,105
param=param_462,The coldest of their kind, they are found beneath the Fremennik mountains. As they are beings of ice, I've found that fire spells inflict far more damage against them.
param=param_466,93
param=param_659,npc_9463

