// 28864
[struct_28864]
param=param_4832,Tri Beam
param=param_4833,Kranon will unleash a huge and continuous burst of energy that will disintegrate anything it hits with huge typeless damage. He will channel and rotate three large beams around the room in an attempt to annihilate any players in the arena.
