// 28888
[struct_28888]
param=param_4832,Tail Sweep
param=param_4833,If the player is within melee range, Raksha will perform a dangerous tail swipe. Being struck by this attack will disable protection prayers and stun the player.
param=param_4835,seq_33706
param=param_4836,seq_33729
param=param_4837,model_120920

// 28889
[struct_28889]
param=param_4832,Trampling Charge
param=param_4833,If the player is stood at a distance, Raksha will charge menacingly at the them. Being struck by this attack will disable protection prayers and stun the player.
param=param_4835,seq_33708

// 28890
[struct_28890]
param=param_4832,Shadow Bomb
param=param_4833,Raksha launches a singular orb of shadow at a target. If hit by this orb, the player will take large <col=FFFFFF>magic</col> damage and become <col=FFFFFF>stunned</col>.
