param=param_463,ganodermic creatures
param=param_460,96
param=param_462,Ganodermic beasts and runts live in the depths of a cave north-east of the Mage Training Arena. The creatures of that dungeon are coated in toxic fungus, so you should fight them from a distance. The fungus helps them repair physical damage, so you might prefer using magical attacks.
param=param_466,95
param=param_659,npc_14696

// 28917
[struct_28917]
param=param_463,Cres's automatons
param=param_460,113
param=param_462,Without their master, Cres's automatons roam Guthix's chambers attacking any who enter. They are programmed to use magic, melee or ranged and can perform a violent area-of-effect attack. Guthix's chambers may be reached via his shrine, or the excavation west of the Legends' Guild.
param=param_465,100
param=param_466,67

