// 28932
[struct_28932]
param=param_4832,Shadow Detonation
param=param_4833,Raksha charges up his levels of shadow anima. If he is able to fully charge, all players in the arena will instantly be killed if they are in line of sight of the resulting blast. A protective dome surrounds Raksha as he is charging up, but it can be damaged, causing shadow anima to spill out across the arena.
