// 29040
[struct_29040]
param=param_463,Elves
param=param_460,56
param=param_462,Elves are skilled fighters across all disciplines from whom you could learn a lot. I recommend challenging only one type of elf combatant at a time.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_1183

// 29041
[struct_29041]
param=param_463,dark beasts
param=param_460,66
param=param_462,Dark beasts are large, dog-like predators with massively muscled bodies that protect them from crushing weapons. We found some while mining the Mourner tunnels, in search of the Temple of Light.
param=param_466,90
param=param_659,npc_2783

// 29042
[struct_29042]
param=param_463,Abyssal demons
param=param_460,180
param=param_462,Abyssal demons are nasty creatures to deal with. They aren't really part of this realm and are able to move very quickly to trap their prey. They can be found in Canifis Slayer Tower and in the Senntisten Asylum.
param=param_466,85
param=param_659,npc_1615

// 29043
[struct_29043]
param=param_463,nechryael
param=param_460,52
param=param_462,Nechryael are demons of decay that summon small winged beings to help them fight their victims. They can be found in the Chaos Tunnels or in Canifis Slayer Tower.
param=param_466,80
param=param_659,npc_1613

// 29044
[struct_29044]
param=param_463,gargoyles
param=param_460,46
param=param_462,Gargoyles are winged creatures of stone. You'll need to fight them until they are close to death before breaking them apart with a rock hammer. They can be found in Canifis Slayer Tower.
param=param_466,75
param=param_659,npc_1610

// 29045
[struct_29045]
param=param_463,TzHaar
param=param_460,101
param=param_462,The TzHaar are mighty warriors - prove yourself against them. You'll find them deep within the Karamja Volcano.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,null

// 29046
[struct_29046]
param=param_463,iron dragons
param=param_460,59
param=param_462,Iron dragons are some of the weaker metallic dragons, with iron scales that are far thicker than normal iron armour. Their fiery breath and sharp claws can be negated by a number of means. Look for them in Brimhaven Dungeon.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_1591

// 29047
[struct_29047]
param=param_463,steel dragons
param=param_460,60
param=param_462,Steel dragons are dangerous and metallic, with steel scales that are far thicker than normal steel armour. Look for them in Brimhaven Dungeon.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_1592

// 29048
[struct_29048]
param=param_463,black dragons
param=param_460,27
param=param_462,Black dragons are among the strongest dragons and are very fierce. Watch out for their fiery breath. I am sure you will have seen them in your travels and have honed your techniques on lesser dragons.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_54

// 29049
[struct_29049]
param=param_463,greater demons
param=param_460,29
param=param_462,Greater demons are weak to ranged attacks. Though not the strongest of demons, they are still dangerous. There are some in Brimhaven Dungeon.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_83

// 29050
[struct_29050]
param=param_463,black demons
param=param_460,30
param=param_462,Black demons are weak to ranged attacks. They're still the strongest demon and very dangerous, however. Seek them out in the Edgeville or Brimhaven dungeons.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_84

// 29051
[struct_29051]
param=param_463,mithril dragons
param=param_460,94
param=param_462,Mithril dragons are very dangerous opponents. There's some in the Ancient Cavern, north of where you'll find Kuradal. You are a battle master - test your skills.
param=param_465,90
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_5363

// 29052
[struct_29052]
param=param_463,kalphites
param=param_460,53
param=param_462,Kalphites are large insects that live in hives under the desert sands. I am sure that, by now, you have seen them to the south-west of Shantay Pass.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_1154

// 29053
[struct_29053]
param=param_463,waterfiends
param=param_460,88
param=param_462,Waterfiends are elemental creatures found north of Kuradal in the Ancient Cavern. Those followed by familiars are keen to slay them.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_5361

// 29054
[struct_29054]
param=param_463,dagannoth
param=param_460,35
param=param_462,Dagannoth are large, sea-dwelling creatures that are very aggressive. You'll often find them in caves near sea water. There is no joy so great as to cleanse these from the face of Gielinor.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_1339

// 29055
[struct_29055]
param=param_463,desert strykewyrms
param=param_460,104
param=param_462,You'll find these east of Al Kharid, atop the mountain. Watch out for their vicious ranged attacks!
param=param_466,79
param=param_659,npc_9465

// 29056
[struct_29056]
param=param_463,ice strykewyrms
param=param_460,105
param=param_462,The coldest of their kind, they are found beneath the Fremennik mountains. As they are beings of ice, I've found that fire spells inflict far more damage against them.
param=param_466,93
param=param_659,npc_9463

// 29057
[struct_29057]
param=param_463,aquanites
param=param_460,95
param=param_462,Aquanites are amphibious creatures that attract prey using the glowing lures on their heads. They attack stronger opponents from a distance with water magic, and dislike those who pray against it. They dwell in the Fremennik Slayer Dungeon, in a chamber past the kurasks.
param=param_466,78
param=param_659,npc_9172

// 29058
[struct_29058]
param=param_463,mutated jadinkos
param=param_460,109
param=param_462,These warped jade vine creatures will not hesitate to use their environment to help them in combat if they cannot retaliate otherwise. The baby jadinkos are easiest to kill, but the males offer the greatest rewards. Ranged weapons made from vines are best against them.
param=param_465,90
param=param_466,80
param=param_659,npc_13821

// 29059
[struct_29059]
param=param_463,Vyrewatch
param=param_460,110
param=param_462,These foul creatures can be found throughout Meiyerditch and Darkmeyer in Morytania. They have a telepathic ability which enables them to dodge incoming attacks, so you'll need a weapon specially created to harm them.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_4837

// 29060
[struct_29060]
param=param_463,ganodermic creatures
param=param_460,96
param=param_462,Ganodermic beasts and runts live in the depths of a cave north-east of the Mage Training Arena. The creatures of that dungeon are coated in toxic fungus, so you should fight them from a distance. The fungus helps them repair physical damage, so you might prefer using magical attacks.
param=param_466,95
param=param_659,npc_14696

// 29061
[struct_29061]
param=param_463,grotworms
param=param_460,112
param=param_462,Grotworms have recently been spotted in a cave near Rimmington. They will bite and attack with some sort of acid spit. Be careful - they are very aggressive.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_15463

// 29062
[struct_29062]
param=param_463,Cres's automatons
param=param_460,113
param=param_462,Without their master, Cres's automatons roam Guthix's chambers attacking any who enter. They are programmed to use magic, melee or ranged and can perform a violent area-of-effect attack. Guthix's chambers may be reached via his shrine, or the excavation west of the Legends' Guild.
param=param_465,100
param=param_466,67

// 29063
[struct_29063]
param=param_463,aviansie
param=param_460,114
param=param_462,Aviansie can be found in the God Wars Dungeon north of Trollheim. As they are flying, you'll find melee attacks are not going to cut it.
param=param_465,70
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_6240

// 29064
[struct_29064]
param=param_463,Order of Ascension members
param=param_460,115
param=param_462,The Order of Ascension are magic users. It is strongly suggested you use ranged attacks. Their tactics can make them tough one-on-one, so bringing a friend along would be beneficial.
param=param_465,105
param=param_466,81
param=param_659,npc_17147

// 29065
[struct_29065]
param=param_463,Airut
param=param_460,117
param=param_462,The airut are aggressive creatures from another world. They have powerful arms and attack with great vigour. Certain abilities can counter and stun them, however.
param=param_465,110
param=param_466,92
param=param_659,npc_18621

// 29066
[struct_29066]
param=param_463,Elves
param=param_460,56
param=param_462,I'm not advocating the killing of my kind, you understand - we enjoy being tested in combat. You'll find melee fighters in Clan Iorwerth's segment of Prifddinas; mages and rangers in Clan Cadarn's segment.
param=param_466,0
param=param_659,npc_1183

// 29067
[struct_29067]
param=param_463,muspah
param=param_460,119
param=param_462,Muspah are creatures born of nightmares. Ancient magic is the most effective thing to use against them. You can find them by travelling to Freneskae. They'll be aggressive unless you wear your shard of Zaros.
param=param_659,npc_19151

// 29068
[struct_29068]
param=param_463,nihil
param=param_460,120
param=param_462,The surviving subjects of Zaros's experiments. They have powerful charge attacks and fight in packs of four. You can find them by travelling to Freneskae. They'll be aggressive unless you wear your shard of Zaros.
param=param_659,npc_19145

// 29069
[struct_29069]
param=param_463,celestial dragons
param=param_460,118
param=param_462,Celestial dragons are one of the strangest dragons I assign. They use melee but also have a powerful dragonfire attack, as well as a fascinating ability to momentarily stop time. You can find them in the depths of Dragontooth Island.
param=param_659,npc_19109

// 29070
[struct_29070]
param=param_463,Kal'gerion demons
param=param_460,121
param=param_462,Kal'gerion demons are powerful creatures that use both magic and melee. They reside in a resource dungeon near Daemonheim. I would recommend you take cover when they smash the ground, or when they use magic to pull you towards them.
param=param_659,npc_14977
param=param_466,90

// 29071
[struct_29071]
param=param_463,glacors
param=param_460,122
param=param_462,Glacors were brought to this world by Lucien. They use magic, ranged and melee attacks. You can find them in an underground cavern on the Frozen Plateau.
param=param_659,npc_14301

// 29072
[struct_29072]
param=param_463,tormented demons
param=param_460,123
param=param_462,Tormented demons are powerful creatures that use magic, ranged and melee attacks. They also have the ability to shield themselves. You can find them below the Tears of Guthix cave.
param=param_659,npc_8349

