// 29099
[struct_29099]
param=param_4832,Pyroclastic Shock
param=param_4833,Orikalka will smash the ground with her tail and create three fissures. Standing in the vicinity of the rumbling fissures will deal <col=FFFFFF>melee crush</col> damage. If the player is afflicted with the <col=FFFFFF>Frostbite</col> debuff, the fissures will grant the <col=FFFFFF>Pyroclastic Shock</col> effect, rapidly increasing their adrenaline and removing the <col=FFFFFF>Frostbite</col> effects.
param=param_4835,seq_33981
param=param_4834,npc_27793

// 29100
[struct_29100]
param=param_4832,Acid Bombardment
param=param_4833,Rathis will occasionally spit out a couple of poisonous, acidic orbs which splash onto the ground below, dealing <col=FFFFFF>ranged</col> damage. Standing in the acid will apply the <col=FFFFFF>Corrosion</col> debuff, causing you to take more damage.
param=param_4835,seq_33990
param=param_4836,seq_33738
param=param_4837,model_121845
param=param_4834,npc_27794

// 29101
[struct_29101]
param=param_4832,Poison Absorption
param=param_4833,Rathis will occasionally roar and absorb any poisonous acid pools on the floor around her. These will significantly <col=FFFFFF>heal</col> her and increase her damage capabilities, unless someone else absorbs the pools first.
param=param_4835,seq_33987
param=param_4834,npc_27794

// 29102
[struct_29102]
param=param_4832,Enrage
param=param_4833,Whenever Nex successfully attacks you, you gain a stacking debuff which signifies how angry she is with you. This effect will begin to negatively affect your defensive capabilities if you allow it to reach high levels.<br>If Nex is tanked too close to a single elemental pillar for too long, she will begin to rapidly gain Enrage stacks.

// 29103
[struct_29103]
param=param_4832,Elemental Lockdown
param=param_4833,Nex will shift her focus to one of the four pillars in the arena and then jumps to the centre of the arena, landing and dealing moderate damage to any players in her vicinity.<br>After landing, she will spawn ice spikes that divide the arena into quadrants. A blood reaver will spawn in each quadrant that Nex isn't targeting.<br>If there are no targets between Nex and her chosen pillar, Nex will be able to draw full power increasing her Enrage stacks by <col=FFFFFF>20</col>.<br>If a target remains in the quadrant, then the connection between Nex and her chosen pillar is severed causing the target player to take the force of the elemental pillar.

// 29104
[struct_29104]
param=param_4832,Blood Reavers
param=param_4833,Blood Reavers spawn and slowly move towards Nex. If they reach her, they will <col=FFFFFF>heal</col> her, and deal <col=FFFFFF>shared damage</col> to all players, for half of their lifepoints, as well as increase her <col=FFFFFF>Enrage</col> effect.

// 29105
[struct_29105]
param=param_4832,Shadow Orbs
param=param_4833,Nex will spawn red orbs on each player's location. They will deal small amounts of damage to anyone stood upon them.

// 29106
[struct_29106]
param=param_4832,The Praesul
param=param_4833,Amalgamations of Smoke, Shadow, Blood and Ice will appear in their respective quadrants. These will give rise to Nex's council of the elements. Umbra, Glacies, Cruor and Fumus will all spawn in a slightly weakened state if their elemental amalgamation is destroyed in time, otherwise they will spawn at full strength.

// 29107
[struct_29107]
param=param_4832,Icicle Slam
param=param_4833,Nex will pick a number of players to trap in ice. Once the players are trapped, she will summon a large icicle above them. If struck by the falling icicle, the player will take substantial damage as damage over time until the icicle breaks or enough damage is dealt.

// 29108
[struct_29108]
param=param_4832,Smoke Blades
param=param_4833,Nex will choose two players randomly and launch a wall of smoke in their direction. Anyone caught in the smoke blades will receive significant magic damage.

// 29109
[struct_29109]
param=param_4832,Unstable Smoke
param=param_4833,Occasionally, Nex will cause a black cloud of smoke to spawn in the arena, containing an unstable smoke crystal. If the crystal is left unchecked, it will explode and deal shared damage to all players. Players can group together around the Unstable Smoke to disperse it amongst themselves for lower damage.

// 29110
[struct_29110]
param=param_4832,Harness Elements
param=param_4833,After she has been sufficiently weakened, Nex will harness the power of her crystals. She gains <col=FFFFFF>invulnerability</col> from them, but in turn, they become vulnerable to attack.

// 29111
[struct_29111]
param=param_4832,Mark of the Elements
param=param_4833,Nex targets a player and marks them to take the full force of the elements. The player has a limited amount of time to enter the safety of the central dome lest they succumb to the elements and be <col=FFFFFF>instantly killed</col>.

