param=param_4832,Virus
param=param_4833,Nex afflicts the players with a virus which drains their stats. The severity of the virus increases over time.

// 29186
[struct_29186]
param=param_4832,Shadow Smash
param=param_4833,Nex will find nearby victims and put a deadly shadow below them. Shortly after placing the shadows, they will erupt, hitting heavy damage on anyone caught in the dark.

// 29187
[struct_29187]
param=param_4832,Blood Absorption
param=param_4833,While the blood crystal is active, Nex is able to <col=FFFFFF>heal</col> herself whenever she attacks a target.

