param=param_2184,The bodyguards of Lady Keli, Apep and Heru are deadly desert mercenaries.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Diamond in the Rough<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: Apep and Heru must be taken on together, with Apep's presence boosting Heru's power. Avoid being hit by Apep's 'whirling dervish' and run away from Heru when he positions his shield towards you to avoid being blinded.
