param=param_2097,2
param=param_2184,A snapshot of the epic battle with Lucien over the Mahjarrat ritual site. Face Khazard, followed by Lucien's minions.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Ritual of the Mahjarrat<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: First, you must face Khazard. While using magic attacks, he will unleash his dog, Bouncer on you. Luckily Wahisietel will join you to destroy Bouncer if you're in his range. With Khazard down, you must face Lucien's ice titans. When encased in ice, struggle to free yourself quickly! Finally, take down Lucien's ice demons while avoiding being trapped by their ice spikes to finish the battle.
