param=param_2123,37
param=param_2124,31
param=param_2097,2
param=param_2184,A Zamorakian mage who attempted to steal the Wand of Resurrection, but was pursued and defeated before she could get away with it.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: The Death of Chivalry<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: Dawn uses her magical abilities to her advantage, casting spells that can knock her opponents away and summoning the dead to assist her in battle. Take down these skeletal warriors first then focus on defeating her.
param=param_2102,Suffer!
param=param_2118,sound_597
param=param_2119,sound_597
param=param_2120,sound_597
param=param_2121,sound_597
