param=param_2127,37
param=param_2128,32
param=param_2097,2
param=param_2184,The dragon hunters were encountered while trying to save the last white dragon.  They are back to extract a little revenge for being beaten.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: One of a Kind<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: The dragon hunters attack with melee, magic and ranged. They have some combat abilities that will stun and bind you, as well as cause higher damage than normal. Taking all three of them on in one go will be a challenge.
param=param_2102,
param=param_2118,sound_2901
