param=param_2184,Lol is the brother to Morningstar, the troll that tried to crush Burthorpe. He is back for vengeance, having been beaten in his quest to win the Bandosian Kyzaj Tournament.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: The Mighty Fall<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: Lol attacks with the highest-tech troll weaponry available: thrown rocks! These rocks are big and heavy enough that they will remain and block your movement. Lol can also make them explode for massive damage.
