// 31575
[struct_31575]
param=param_4832,Blight-afflicted Core
param=param_4833,Solak will attempt to absorb anima from the grove by rooting his body into the ground. You must attack Solak's limbs and inflict enough damage on them to incapacitate him, causing his <col=FFFFFF>Blight-afflicted Core</col> to become exposed. The core must be defeated in order to proceed.

// 31576
[struct_31576]
param=param_4832,The Storm Within
param=param_4833,Solak causes a <col=FFFFFF>Blighted Anima Storm</col>, causing <col=FFFFFF>Blight Bombs</col> to periodically drop to the ground. The <col=FFFFFF>Anima Eruptions</col> must be destroyed in order to get closer to the <col=FFFFFF>Blighted Anima Storm</col> to dispel it.

// 31577
[struct_31577]
param=param_4832,Blighted Anima Rain
param=param_4833,Solak will cause multiple <col=FFFFFF>Blight Bombs</col> to rain down upon the arena. Carefully utilise <col=FFFFFF>Nature's Blessing</col> to survive this attack.

// 31578
[struct_31578]
param=param_4832,Binding Crush
param=param_4833,Solak will select a random player, stunning them and dragging them. He will smash one of his arms down onto the player and <col=FFFFFF>instantly kill</col> them if they do not escape. Solak unleashes this attack with such malice and force, his arm will become briefly stuck in the ground - the players may use this to their advantage.

// 31579
[struct_31579]
param=param_4832,Blight Leak
param=param_4833,Solak becomes engulfed in blight magic, overwhelming him and unleashing <col=FFFFFF>5</col> huge shockwaves that will strike every player in the arena for huge <col=FFFFFF>Blight</col> damage.

// 31580
[struct_31580]
param=param_4832,Rooting Claw
param=param_4833,Roots will shoot up through the ground around Solak's current target, rapidly dealing <col=FFFFFF>Blight</col> damage to anyone standing on them. <col=FFFFFF>Blight Bombs</col> are also dropped onto other players, causing further roots to rapidly move between the afflicted players.

// 31581
[struct_31581]
param=param_4832,Nature Sigils
param=param_4833,<col=FFFFFF>Merethiel</col> will conjure <col=FFFFFF>8</col> green sigils around the arena. When Solak is lured upon them, they will start to drain the corruption from within him.<br><br>Every time a sigil is filled with corruption, <col=FFFFFF>Merethiel</col> will disable Solak, allowing you to enter <col=FFFFFF>Solak's Mind</col> and defeat <col=FFFFFF>Erethdor</col>.

// 31582
[struct_31582]
param=param_4832,Blight Siphon
param=param_4833,Solak slams the ground with blight energy, causing all players to be rapidly struck with increasingly dangerous levels of <col=FFFFFF>Blight</col> damage. The only way to prevent Solak from continuously channelling the damage is to have enough players use <col=FFFFFF>stun abilities</col> on him.

