// 32140
[struct_32140]
param=param_4832,Stage 3.6 : The end
param=param_4833,Vorago raises his arms in the air and then slams them down, blocking off a corner of the room. Anyone outside of this area will begin to suffocate. <br><br>Vorago then moves his arms one by one 90 degrees anti-clockwise. In three of the corners he blocks you into there will be a bomb. <br><br>The magic and explosive bombs can be activated to drain one charge, firing that type of bomb at the player who activated it. The vitalis bomb can be activated to set it off, turning the team into explosive vitali.<br><br>At the end of his attack, Vorago will activate the vitalis bomb, if it has not been activated already, and fire the remaining explosive bombs at the team.
param=param_4835,seq_25434
param=param_4834,npc_17182

// 32141
[struct_32141]
param=param_4832,Stage 3.6 : Vitalis bomb
param=param_4833,The third bomb reached during 'the end' will also be fired by Vorago in the later stages of the encounter. This bomb will turn you into a vitalis and home in on you for a number of seconds, exploding on impact to reduce adrenaline and deal damage to everyone nearby. On impact, the bomb will sap adrenaline from anyone it hits except for its main target. Use of the <col=E6DCB4>Barricade</col> ability could help to manage these bombs.
param=param_4834,npc_17182

