param=param_5675,Heart of Gielinor: Encampment
param=param_5346,With the discovery of the Heart of Gielinor it is time to prepare for the fight of your life. Help Ajjat to train a band of plucky young recruits or help to build statues of the bosses you will be encountering in the dungeon to help steel adventurers on their way in. Each day you will receive 100 basic tools and by using your skills you can help to unlock an energised arm cannon. Golden tools can be won from Treasure Hunter to advance your progress further.<br><br>Working together as a community you can unlock mystery boxes, increase the level of the cannon and unlock overrides and an emote.

