param=param_4854,1
param=param_4853,1
param=param_7140,1
param=param_4858,Provides a cornucopia of food that never depletes. It can heal some life points every 5 minutes.<br><col=0xEB2F2F>This item is removed when you transition from Fresh Start Worlds.
param=param_4862,1
param=param_5093,Claimed
param=param_5204,You have claimed this.
param=param_5091,Claim
param=param_7141,You need to gain more progress points to claim this.

// 34366
[struct_34366]
param=param_4849,Boon of Plenty II
param=param_4850,3500
param=param_4851,obj_50442
param=param_4854,1
param=param_7140,1
param=param_4858,Provides a collection of items that can help you level your skills. This includes:<br>- 10 tiny portable skilling packs, which hold portable skilling stations that let you train certain skills more efficiently until consumed.<br>- 10 combat dummies, which let you train your combat skills until consumed.<br>- 5 medium skill training dummy crates, which hold dummies that let you train certain skills until consumed.
param=param_4862,1
param=param_5093,Claimed
param=param_5204,You have claimed this.
param=param_5091,Claim
param=param_7141,You need to gain more progress points to claim this.

// 34367
[struct_34367]
param=param_4849,Boon of Plenty III
param=param_4850,4500
param=param_4851,obj_31612
param=param_4854,1
param=param_7140,1
param=param_4858,Provides a collection of items that can help you level your skills. This includes:<br>- The spring cleaner, which can convert selected enemy drops into various helpful resources while charged with springs or tight springs.<br>- 100 tight springs, which can charge or upgrade the spring cleaner.<br>- The silverhawk boots, which periodically grant Agility XP while running or skilling, if charged with silverhawk feathers or down.<br>- 100 silverhawk down, which can charge the silverhawk boots.<br>- 100 magic notepaper, which can note items to make them stackable.<br>If you already own the spring cleaner or silverhawk boots, you will not receive them from this collection.
param=param_4862,1
param=param_5093,Claimed
param=param_5204,You have claimed this.
param=param_5091,Claim
param=param_7141,You need to gain more progress points to claim this.

