// 35394
[struct_35394]
param=param_4832,Vindicta & Gorvek
param=param_4833,Representing Zaros as General, the deadly duo of Vindicta & Gorvek await any players who step forward.

// 35395
[struct_35395]
param=param_4832,Phase 1 - Ranged attack
param=param_4833,If Vindicta is unable to attack the player she will use her ranged attack.

// 35396
[struct_35396]
param=param_4832,Phase 1 - Dragonfire
param=param_4833,After a few attacks and raising her sword in the air, Vindicta will call on Gorvek to unleash dragonfire on her target, dealing rapid magic damage.

// 35397
[struct_35397]
param=param_4832,Phase 2 - Gorvek
param=param_4833,Upon dropping to a certain amount of lifepoints Vindicta will mount Gorvek, during this time a mix of melee and ranged attacks follow.
param=param_4835,seq_28260

// 35398
[struct_35398]
param=param_4832,Phase 2 - Dragonfire wall
param=param_4833,Once the melee and ranged attacks have finished, Gorvek comes down from above and leaves a trail of dragonfire.
param=param_4834,npc_22463
param=param_4835,seq_28277
param=param_4836,seq_28278

// 35399
[struct_35399]
param=param_4832,Phase 3 - Hard Mode
param=param_4833,In Hard Mode, Vindicta and Gorvek have a combined total of 600,000 lifepoints making them a formidable boss to take on. During Hard Mode they will also attack faster resulting in higher damage per second.

