[struct_35456]
param=param_4832,Burn Phase (Explosion)
param=param_4833,As the Burn Phase is ongoing, a bar will start to degrade above the Twin Furies heads, once depleted the Furies will emit a huge and powerful explosion.
param=param_4835,seq_28513
param=param_4836,seq_28515

// 35457
[struct_35457]
param=param_4832,Lava Bomb: Hard Mode
param=param_4833,A Lava Bomb will bounce around the arena, dealing large damage to anything it touches and exploding on the last bounce, keep an eye out for a green marker which informs you where the Lava Bomb will land.

// 35458
[struct_35458]
param=param_4832,Lava Bomb (Blue): Hard Mode
param=param_4833,At times a Blue Lava Bomb will appear in the arena, this has a different effect to the normal Lava Bombs, if the player stands underneath the Blue Bomb as it hits them it will reflect on to the Twin Furies dealing damage to them.<br><br>However, if the player is unable to reflect the Blue Bomb back to the Twin Furies after a few attempts the Blue Bomb will lock on to a player and deal high damage.

// 35459
[struct_35459]
param=param_4832,Helwyr
param=param_4833,A general of Seren's army, Helwyr uses elven magic to draw upon the energy of the creature he possesses.

// 35460
[struct_35460]
param=param_4832,The aid of Nature.
param=param_4833,During the fight Helywr may call upon nature to help him out, at this moment three gas-puffing mushrooms appear (six if you're in Hard mode) and will deal damage if you are near them.

// 35461
[struct_35461]
param=param_4832,Rake
param=param_4833,Helwyr uses his claws to rake an area in front of him dealing bleed damage to you if you're hit by it.
param=param_4835,seq_28214
param=param_4836,seq_28216

// 35462
[struct_35462]
param=param_4832,Rend
param=param_4833,When Rend is in effect any attack Helwyr strikes with will cause bleed damage, the bleed effect will stack on top of Rake.

// 35463
[struct_35463]
param=param_4832,Thrash
param=param_4833,Helwyr pounces a random player and thrashes around, biting and clawing everything around
param=param_4835,seq_28215

// 35464
[struct_35464]
param=param_4832,Cywir Alphas
param=param_4833,Helwyr calls in a pack of Cywir Alphas, these deal quick damage and should be killed quickly to avoid losing life.
param=param_4835,seq_28213
param=param_4836,seq_28217

// 35465
[struct_35465]
param=param_4832,Gregorovic
param=param_4833,Gregorovic is the general of Sliske's army, possessing accurate and high-damage attacks.

// 35466
[struct_35466]
param=param_4832,Attack
param=param_4833,Using his glaives, Gregorovic can utilize <col=FFFFFF>melee</col> and <col=FFFFFF>ranged</col> attacks, Gregorovic is also capable of poisoning the player in quick intervals.
param=param_4835,seq_28226

// 35467
[struct_35467]
param=param_4832,Spirits
param=param_4833,Gregorovic summons a Spirit of Rage, Spirit of Delirium or Spirit of Mania from the respective masks depending on where Gregorovic is positioned when he uses that ability, if you're fighting Gregorovic in Hard Mode two spirits will be spawned instead of one.

// 35468
[struct_35468]
param=param_4832,Glaives
param=param_4833,Gregorovic will toss both of his glaives into the air, shadows will appear throughout the arena in a scattered formation. After two seconds, daggers and knives will fall from the ceiling and deal magic damage onto the player.
param=param_4835,seq_28228

// 35469
[struct_35469]
param=param_4832,Shadow Clones
param=param_4833,Upon reaching a certain threshold of lifepoints, Gregorovic will summon 2/3 shadows, these shadows have a small amount of lifepoints, while the shadows are alive Gregorovic can swap places with the shadow copies.
param=param_4835,seq_28234
param=param_4836,seq_28235

// 35470
[struct_35470]
param=param_4832,Phase one - Awakening
param=param_4833,Telos awakens, and begins the fight with 4 main abilities.
param=param_4834,npc_22891

// 35471
[struct_35471]
param=param_4832,Beam of pure anima
param=param_4833,A green beam of anima will appear across the platform. Standing inside the beam will increase adrenaline gain, whilst draining prayer points. Telos' anima will increase faster if it is standing in the beam.

// 35472
[struct_35472]
param=param_4832,Siphoning tendrils
param=param_4833,Telos will channel a tendril attack which drains adrenaline. Whilst the tendril is being channeled, Telos will both heal, and rapidly gain anima. The channel can be broken by dealing damage.
param=param_4835,seq_28931

// 35473
[struct_35473]
param=param_4832,Double tap
param=param_4833,Telos will deal <col=FFFFFF>melee</col> damage that stuns the target, followed up by a jump dealing typeless damage.
param=param_4835,seq_28935

// 35474
[struct_35474]
param=param_4832,Energy sword
param=param_4833,Telos will charge his sword with energy, and perform a slice dealing high typeless damage.
param=param_4835,seq_28938

// 35475
[struct_35475]
param=param_4849,Master Runecrafter robe
param=param_4850,4000
param=param_4851,obj_21516
param=param_4853,1
param=param_4854,1
param=param_6406,1
param=param_4858,Grants 1% bonus Runecrafting XP while worn. A full set grants an additional 1% bonus.
param=param_4862,1

// 35476
[struct_35476]
param=param_4832,Phase two - Corruption
param=param_4833,Upon entering phase two, Telos gains the ability to use onslaught. Alongside this, the beam is now corrupt.

// 35477
[struct_35477]
param=param_4832,Beam of corrupt anima
param=param_4833,A black beam of anima will appear across the platform. Standing inside the beam will reduce all damage taken & damage dealt. This has the same effect on Telos if stood inside the beam.

// 35478
[struct_35478]
param=param_4832,Onslaught
param=param_4833,Telos begins channelling onslaught,which is a magic attack with each consecutive hit becoming stronger. This ability continues until Telos is drained of anima.
param=param_4835,seq_28959

// 35479
[struct_35479]
param=param_4832,Phase three - Volcanic
param=param_4833,Telos attacks primarily with <col=FFFFFF>magic</col>, and gains two additional abilities depending on its anima. Minions will also be charging Telos with anima.

// 35480
[struct_35480]
param=param_4832,Charging golems
param=param_4833,Three charging minions will be active, charging Telos with anima. They can be brought to 0 health to prevent them from charging Telos, however will regenerate after a short period of time.

// 35481
[struct_35481]
param=param_4832,Adrenaline drain
param=param_4833,If Telos' anima is in the lower red section of the bar, It will periodically drain your adrenaline.

// 35482
[struct_35482]
param=param_4832,Explosion
param=param_4833,If Telos' anima is in the higher red section of the bar, it periodically causes explosions, dealing high amounts of damage.

// 35483
[struct_35483]
param=param_4832,Phase four - Overwhelmed
param=param_4833,Telos attacks primarily with <col=FFFFFF>melee</col>, however will begin to use <col=FFFFFF>magic</col> if out of range.

// 35484
[struct_35484]
param=param_4832,Golems of anima
param=param_4833,Telos gains the ability to summon three minions when reaching a certain percentage of health remaining. All of the summoned minions will deal <col=FFFFFF>melee</col> damage.

// 35485
[struct_35485]
param=param_4832,Pure golem
param=param_4833,Pure golems deal significantly more damage than the others.
param=param_4834,npc_22905

// 35486
[struct_35486]
param=param_4832,Corrupt golem
param=param_4833,Corrupt golems add the break armour stacking debuff, reducing the targets armour by 1% per stack.
param=param_4834,npc_22906

// 35487
[struct_35487]
param=param_4832,Volcanic golem
param=param_4833,Volcanic golems have the ability to stun and bind their target.
param=param_4834,npc_22907

// 35488
[struct_35488]
param=param_4832,Draw power
param=param_4833,Telos begins to draw power from an active font, until reaching enough power to launch an instant-kill attack. Standing beside the fonts for long enough will provide a shield from this attack.
param=param_4835,seq_28965

// 35489
[struct_35489]
param=param_4832,Phase five - It's not over yet! (100% enrage)
param=param_4833,Telos rises from the pool of anima, gaining new abilities.

// 35490
[struct_35490]
param=param_4832,All of the beams
param=param_4833,All beams seen in phases one, two & three will be active during this phase. They will periodically switch positions with other active beams.

// 35491
[struct_35491]
param=param_4832,All of the minions
param=param_4833,Telos summons six minions of one specific type. These minions must be killed beside their respective font to charge it. Once charged it can be used to interrupt Telos's devastating attack.

// 35492
[struct_35492]
param=param_4832,Rockfall
param=param_4833,High damage dealing rocks begin to fall at the current location, dealing high damage on hit.

// 35493
[struct_35493]
param=param_4832,The end
param=param_4833,Telos begins charging an instant-kill attack, which can only be prevented by using an active font against it.
param=param_4835,seq_28952

// 35494
[struct_35494]
param=param_4832,I don't think so (1000%+ enrage)
param=param_4833,Immortality no longer works against "The end" attack.

// 35495
[struct_35495]
param=param_4832,Shake the roof (1000%+ enrage)
param=param_4833,Five rocks will now fall instead of one.

