param=param_6427,0
param=param_6414,Ardougne cloak 1 and a magic lamp worth 1,000xp in a skill of your choice.<br>The cloak confers the following benefits:<br>- Unlimited teleports to the monastery south of Ardougne.<br>- 40% of items dropped in the Tower of Life will be noted.<br>- Improved rate of success when stealing from stalls in East Ardougne's market.<br>You will be able to sell cats to citizens for double the normal number of death runes.<br>On entering a game of Castle Wars your Prayer points will be boosted by 10%. <br>- 25% chance of two chompy birds appearing when chompy hunting.
