param=param_6412,"shields,17"
param=param_6426,enum_11692
param=param_6427,0
param=param_6414,Ardougne cloak 2 and a magic lamp worth 7,500xp in a skill of your choice. Wizard Cromperty will offer you 100 noted essence per day.<br>The cloak gains the following extra benefits:<br>- Teleport to the Farming patch north of Ardougne once per day.<br>- Improved rate of success when picking pockets in Ardougne.<br>- Double length PvP immunity after pulling the Wilderness teleport lever.<br>- 60% of items dropped in the Tower of Life will be noted.<br>- Improved yield from crafting runes at Ourania Altar.<br>Talk to the town crier to toggle your ring of life teleport destination to Ardougne. <br>- 50% chance of two chompy birds appearing when chompy hunting.
param=param_6416,1
param=param_6413,1310
param=param_6417,1702
param=param_6755,10

