param=param_6414,Desert amulet 1 and a magic lamp worth 2,000 XP in a skill of your choice.<br>A daily bag of lost & found items from a rug merchant.<br>Sparkly dung kalphites drop double loot.<br>2% cheaper prices in the pizazz store.<br>Double water from cacti.
