param=param_6412,"shields,62"
param=param_6426,enum_11709
param=param_6427,0
param=param_6414,Desert amulet 3 and a magic lamp worth 20,000 XP in a skill of your choice. 30 noted potato cacti per day, claimed from the Weird Old Man.<br>10% cheaper prices in the pizazz store.<br>Double charges from artefacts when recharging the Sceptre of the Gods.<br>Cactus patches in the desert will be protected from disease and you'll get double the spines.<br>Half the chance of mummies and scarabs spawning in Pyramid Plunder.<br>The Keris has a greater chance to score a vicious blow.<br>The amulet can now produce a total of 100 molten glass per day.
param=param_6416,1
param=param_6413,1315
param=param_6417,1702
param=param_6755,15

