param=param_6414,Morytania legs 2 and a magic lamp worth 10,000XP in a skill of your choice. Robin offers 13 lots of bonemeal in exchange for bones, and 13 free buckets of slime per day. Razmire offers a daily choice of free planks, upgrades all olive oil vials being bought from his shop to 4 doses for free and lets you use the pyre log storage chests in Mort'ton.<br>The legs gain the following additional benefits:<br>- Ability to teleport to the slime pit under the Ectofuntus 5 times daily.<br>- Cannonball-smithing time is halved in Port Phasmatys.<br>- The mushroom patch near Canifis will no longer become diseased.<br>- Haunted tools will no longer attack you in the Abandoned Mine.
