param=param_6411,Given by the Strange Old Man, at the Barrows, for completing all Hard Tasks in Morytania.
param=param_6414,Morytania legs 3 and a magic lamp worth 20,000XP in a skill of your choice. Robin offers 26 lots of bonemeal in exchange for bones, and 26 free buckets of slime per day.<br>The legs gain the following additional benefits:<br>- Increased chance of gaining better keys from burning shades.<br>- 50% more Prayer XP by burning shades.<br>- All ghosts will now talk to you as if you were wearing the Amulet of Ghostspeak.<br>- Prayer drain in the Barrows is reduced by 50%.<br>- Receive double runes from Barrows chests.<br>- 10% more Temple Trekking rewards.<br>- 50% chance that Blood Altar teletabs don't break on use.<br>- Access to a shortcut that leads to the Abandoned mine crystal outcrops.
param=param_6412,"shields,34"
param=param_6426,enum_12272
param=param_6427,0
param=param_6416,1
param=param_6413,1343
param=param_6417,1702
param=param_6755,15

