param=param_1274,<col=0xFFCB05>Talk to Bryll Thoksdottir</col> at the <col=0xFFCB05>Taverley pier</col> to sail to the <col=0xFFCB05>Daemonheim</col> peninsula.
param=param_1275,Head north-west to the entrance to Daemonheim, and claim a <col=0xFFCB05>Ring of Kinship</col> from the <col=0xFFCB05>Dungeoneering tutor</col>.
param=param_1276,<col=0xFFCB05>Right-click</col> the <col=0xFFCB05>Ring of Kinship</col> in your <col=0xFFCB05>backpack</col> and choose <col=0xFFCB05>Teleport to Daemonheim</col>.
