param=param_1276,You may also gain enriched memories when draining normal wisps, if you are particularly lucky.
param=param_2225,Collected memories can be taken to one of the craters located near wisp colonies. Here, you can convert the memories into experience or energy. Enriched memories will give a greater amount of experience or energy when converted.
param=param_1294,26
