// 39804
[struct_39804]
param=param_2795,When praying <col=0x00ffff>Thick Skin</col>, <col=0x00ffff>Rock Skin</col>, or <col=0x00ffff>Steel Skin</col>, you gain an additional <col=0x00ff00>+2 Defence</col>.<br>Lasts <col=0x00ffff>30 minutes</col>.

// 39805
[struct_39805]
param=param_2795,When praying <col=0x00ffff>Protect From</col> or <col=0x00ffff>Deflect From</col>, you gain <col=0x00ff00>+10%</col> damage reduction, to a total of <col=0x00ff00>60%</col>.<br>Lasts <col=0x00ffff>30 minutes</col>.

// 39806
[struct_39806]
param=param_2795,When praying <col=0x00ffff>Protect Item</col>, you protect <col=0x00ff00>1 extra item</col>, to a total of <col=0x00ff00>2</col> items.<br>Lasts <col=0x00ffff>30 minutes</col>.

// 39807
[struct_39807]
param=param_2795,When grinding bones at the <col=0x00ffff>Ectofuntus</col>, you grind all bones in your backpack at once.<br>Lasts <col=0x00ffff>30 minutes</col>.

// 39808
[struct_39808]
param=param_2795,When burying bones, you gain <col=0x00ff00>+250% Prayer XP</col>.<br>Lasts <col=0x00ffff>30 minutes</col>.

// 39809
[struct_39809]
param=param_2795,Gain <col=0x00ffff>prayer points</col> equal to <col=0x00ff00>2.5%</col> of any damage you receive.<br>Lasts <col=0x00ffff>30 minutes</col>.

