param=param_1275,<col=0xFFCB05>Mask part 2</col> is dropped by <col=0xFFCB05>corpse spider</col> (room 2) and <col=0xFFCB05>warped fly</col> (room 3).
param=param_1276,<col=0xFFCB05>Mask part 3</col> is dropped by <col=0xFFCB05>crawling corpse torso</col> (room 4), <col=0xFFCB05>warped rat</col> (room 5) and <col=0xFFCB05>skeleton</col> (room 6).
param=param_1277,<col=0xFFCB05>Mask part 4</col> is dropped by <col=0xFFCB05>warped bat</col> (room 7), <col=0xFFCB05>corpse archer</col> (room 8), <col=0xFFCB05>skoblin</col> (room 9) and <col=0xFFCB05>corpse mage</col> (room 10).
param=param_1278,<col=0xFFCB05>Mask part 5</col> is dropped by <col=0xFFCB05>Dragith Nurn</col> (room 11).
param=param_2225,When you have all 5 mask parts, use a mask part on a mask part in your backpack to assemble the mask of Dragith Nurn.
param=param_6414,Mask of Dragith Nurn cosmetic helmet override in Wardrobe interface.

