// 47041
[struct_47041]
param=param_463,dagannoth
param=param_460,35
param=param_462,Dagannoth are large, sea-dwelling creatures that are very aggressive. You'll often find them in caves near seawater.
param=param_465,60
param=param_466,1
param=param_659,npc_1341

// 47042
[struct_47042]
param=param_463,aviansies
param=param_460,114
param=param_462,Aviansies can be found within the God Wars Dungeon north of Trollheim. As they fly, you'll find it difficult to reach them with melee weapons, so try using ranged or magic weapons instead.
param=param_466,1
param=param_659,npc_6240

// 47043
[struct_47043]
param=param_463,kalphites
param=param_460,53
param=param_462,Kalphites are large insectoids that live in hives under the Kharidian desert. You can find them southwest of Shantay Pass.
param=param_466,1
param=param_659,npc_1154

// 47044
[struct_47044]
param=param_463,hellhounds
param=param_460,31
param=param_462,Hellhounds are Shakroth class Avernic demons, the lowest class of demons from Infernus. You can find them in Taverley Dungeon and will find slash weapons effective against them.
param=param_465,70
param=param_466,1
param=param_659,npc_49

// 47045
[struct_47045]
param=param_463,aberrant spectres
param=param_460,41
param=param_462,Aberrant spectres are fetid, vile ghosts. The very smell of them will paralyze and harm you. I would advise using a nose peg to avoid their stink. You would do well using a ranged weapon against them.
param=param_466,60
param=param_659,npc_1604

// 47046
[struct_47046]
param=param_463,ripper demons
param=param_460,131
param=param_462,Ripper demons enjoy the bloodlust of battle, a sentiment I can agree with. They will expose your weaknesses, hitting you harder the worse your injuries are. They can be found in a fissure east of Al Kharid.
param=param_466,96
param=param_659,npc_21994

// 47047
[struct_47047]
param=param_463,camel warriors
param=param_460,132
param=param_462,Camel Warriors use ancient magics to attack you. They can use cowardly disorientation magic to confuse you. You can find them in the deep desert, teach them a lesson in humility.
param=param_466,96
param=param_659,npc_22001

// 47048
[struct_47048]
param=param_463,acheron mammoths
param=param_460,133
param=param_462,Acheron mammoths are honourable and proud beasts from the frozen north that know the true worth of battle. When they charge you, ensure you get out of the way. They can be found on an iceberg that is accessible from a dock east of Rellekka.
param=param_466,96
param=param_659,npc_22007

// 47049
[struct_47049]
param=param_463,living wyverns
param=param_460,130
param=param_462,Living wyverns breathe a poison that will rapidly kill you unless you can freeze your blood using the glacial temperature of their home. But watch out; the colder you are, the harder their regular attacks will hit you. They can be found within the Asgarnia Ice Dungeon.
param=param_466,96
param=param_659,npc_21812

